@startuml
title Intelligent Auto Homing End-to-End Sequence Diagram

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor LightBlue
    BorderColor DarkBlue
}

    actor "Operator\n(or Auto trigger e.g., scale-out event, SLA violation)" as Trigger
box SMO
    participant  NonRT as "Non-RT RIC\n(rApps / Policies)"
    participant NFO as "NFO\n(NF Orchestrator)"
    participant FOCOM as "FOCOM\n(Federated O-Cloud Mgmt)"
end box
participant OSS as "OSS/BSS"
participant "Vendor Repo\n(xNF Package / XnFD / Helm)" as Vendor
participant "O-Cloud-DMS\n(ETSI Profile component)" as DMS
participant "O-Cloud-IMS\n(Infrastructure Management)" as IMS
participant "O-Cloud Site\n(K8s Cluster / DMS Runtime)" as OCloud
note over  NonRT, FOCOM
Devtron ??
end note

note over DMS
Tacker 
end note

note over IMS, OCloud
StarlingX
end note

note across
Preconditions:
1. SMO/NFO, Non-RT RIC, FOCOM integrated; O-Cloud exposes O2 (IMS/DMS).
2. Vendor xNF package available in repo (if applicable).
3. policies are pre-configured in OSS/BSS.
end note


== Policy & Trigger ==
opt Auto Trigger Conditions like auto Healing/Scaling
NonRT -> NFO: 1. NF Instatiate Request
else Initiated by Operator
Trigger -> NFO: 1. NF Instantiate Request\n(intent: NF type, slices, location hints)
end
NFO-> OSS: 2. Query Policies\n(e.g., energy prefs, user density)
OSS --> NFO: 2.1. Return Policy Data

== Descriptor & Manifest Footprint ==
NFO -> Vendor: 3. Get xNF Package / XnFD / CN descriptors
activate Vendor
Vendor --> NFO: 3.1. Provide XnFD + CN descriptors (+ optional vendor artifacts)
deactivate Vendor

NFO -> NFO: 4. Extract NF Constraints & Requirement\n(e.g., latency <50ms, CPU>4cores;\nfrom NSD/VNFD)
== Intelligent Homing Suggestion ==
NFO-> NonRT: 5. Request Homing Recommendation\n(forward constraints, topology query)
activate NonRT
NonRT -> FOCOM: 6. Query Available Resources\n(O2: cluster inventory, load metrics)
FOCOM -> IMS: 7. Check Resource Availability
IMS --> FOCOM: 7.1. Resource Data
FOCOM--> NonRT: 6.1. Return Resource Data
NonRT -> FOCOM: 8. Query Infra Status\n(O2: capacity, faults, energy usage)
FOCOM -> IMS: Check Infra Status
IMS --> FOCOM: Infra Details
FOCOM--> NonRT: 8.1 Return Infra Data
NonRT -> NonRT: 10. AI/ML Analysis\n(rApp: predict optimal cluster;\nML model e.g., GNN for topology;\nconsider policies, historical data)
NonRT --> NFO: 10.1 Return Recommended Cluster IDs\n (e.g., site-3, edge for low latency)

== Resource Discovery & Homing Decision ==
opt
  NFO -> FOCOM: 11. Query federated O-Cloud inventory (candidate clusters)
  activate FOCOM
  FOCOM -> IMS: 12. Query site IMS inventories (flavors, accel, health)
  activate IMS
  IMS -> IMS: 12.1. Local capability check
  IMS --> FOCOM: 12.2. Site Inventory Response
  deactivate IMS
  FOCOM --> NFO: 13. Federated Resource List (candidates)
  deactivate FOCOM
end
NFO -> NFO: 14. Homing Decision — score candidates using final resource requirements + NonRT-RIC response

== Deployment ==
NFO -> DMS: 15. Deploy NF Request (O2-DMS): reference xNF package + parameterized manifests
activate DMS

DMS -> OCloud: 16. Instantiate CNF / Helm install (apply CPU pinning, DPDK, SR-IOV)
activate OCloud
OCloud -> OCloud: 16.1. Health probes and readiness checks

alt Deployment Success
    OCloud --> DMS: 17. Deployment ACK (NF ACTIVE)
    DMS -> NFO: 18. Deployment Success + instance id / endpoint info
else Deployment Failure
    OCloud --> DMS: 17b. Deployment NACK (reason)
deactivate OCloud
    DMS -> NFO: 18b. Deployment Failed (reason)
    DMS -> Trigger: 19. Notify operator (optional)
end

deactivate OCloud
deactivate DMS

note over Trigger, OCloud
Post-Flow: re-homing allowed via heal/scale triggers; metric feed to Non-RT RIC for policy loop.
end note
@enduml
